

Incoming Request URL ➔ Express checks routes in ORDER they are defined

1️⃣ Does it match router.use("/:itemId/reviews", reviewRouter)?
    └── If URL is like /items/abc123/reviews → YES ✅ handled by reviewRouter

2️⃣ Else, does it match router.get("/", getAllItems)?
    └── If URL is exactly /items → YES ✅ handled by getAllItems

3️⃣ Else, does it match router.get("/:itemId", getSingleItem)?
    └── If URL is like /items/abc123 → YES ✅ handled by getSingleItem

4️⃣ Else, 404 Not Found
